cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "EU Air Traffic: an open platform for live and historical European airspace analytics"
abstract: >-
  A self-hosted platform that collects live and scheduled European air traffic
  data, builds Bronze, Silver and Gold layers with dbt, and publishes a
  read-only serving copy for a browser dashboard. It ingests ADS-B positions,
  OpenSky movements, AirLabs schedules, METAR/TAF and forecast weather, fuel
  prices, and official Eurostat airport passenger figures, and estimates fuel
  burn and CO2 with a precomputed OpenAP grid.
type: software
